Each time one of your spells criticals, you project a bolt of light or shadow at up to [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] targets within radius 6, doing [41, 55, 66, 75, 83 (TL1-5; SP 100)] light damage or [41, 55, 66, 75, 83 (TL1-5; SP 100)] darkness damage per bolt.

This effect costs 2 positive or 2 negative energy each time it's triggered, and will not activate if either your positive or negative energy is below 2.

The damage scales with your Spellpower.

This spell cannot crit.
